--- note ---
Trained on a clean tree at 3c67019. params/env.yaml here is exactly what
trained this policy, and the MicroDuck roulade recipe it retargets is unchanged
since the fork point.

    unset MICRODUCK_WARM_START     # fresh task: no teacher to inherit from
    .venv/Scripts/python.exe -u -m mjlab.scripts.train \
      Mjlab-Roulade-Flat-XgoDuck --env.scene.num-envs 2048 \
      --agent.max_iterations 6000 --agent.save-interval 250

2048, not 4096: the all-collisions MJCF needs 2.5 GB of EPA convex buffers at
4096, and 2048 on an 8 GB card trips WDDM paging (7719/8188 MiB, 40 s/iter).
2048 sits at 4121 MiB / 2.7 s/iter. See docs/XGODUCK.md.
